cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use IELTS-API in your research or teaching, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
title: "IELTS-API: a free and open REST API for IELTS study data"
type: software
authors:
  - given-name: IELTS-API
    family-name: Contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnlikescarrot/IELTS-API"
url: "https://github.com/johnlikescarrot/IELTS-API"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source REST API serving structured IELTS study data: academic
  vocabulary with CEFR levels, speaking topics for Parts 1-3, academic and
  general training writing prompts, common learner mistakes with corrections,
  band-score descriptors, and an official-rule overall band-score calculator.
  Requires no authentication or API key.
keywords:
  - IELTS
  - ESL
  - EFL
  - vocabulary
  - REST API
  - open data
  - education
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-04"
